ives/edgar/data/1829864/000182986426000113/0001829864-26-000113-index.htm","accession":"0001829864-26-000113"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in 6 of the last 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1829864/000182986426000113/0001829864-26-000113-index.htm","accession":"0001829864-26-000113"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $177.4m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1829864/000182986426000113/0001829864-26-000113-index.htm","accession":"0001829864-26-000113"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-0.6% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1829864/000182986426000113/0001829864-26-000113-index.htm","accession":"0001829864-26-000113"}],"bear":[{"text":"Debt of $491.6m against equity of $275.0m. Leverage decides who controls the outcome if trading deteriorates, and it is not the shareholder.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1829864/000182986426000113/0001829864-26-000113-index.htm","accession":"0001829864-26-000113"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 7.9% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (36,406 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1829864/000213844326000007/0002138443-26-000007-index.htm"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.5% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1829864/000213844326000007/0002138443-26-000007-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, J